<title>SINGAPORE: Rotol slips to 1st-half net loss.</title>
<headline>Rotol slips to 1st-half net loss.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				   0.50  vs  1.41 (profit)</p>
<p>    Loss per share (cents)		 0.61  vs  NA</p>
<p>    Turnover				  13.23  vs  10.57</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	  0.34  vs  0.14</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		     0.03  vs  0.11</p>
<p>    Depreciation			     0.51  vs  0.51</p>
<p>    Loss from associates		    nil  vs  0.10</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss			     0.43  vs  2.16 (profit)</p>
<p>    Provision for tax			0.04  vs  0.71</p>
<p>    Minorities			(loss) 0.03  vs  0.04 (loss)</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		 (gain) 2.46  vs   nil</p>
<p>Note - Rotol Singapore Ltd designs and makes aluminium claddings, curtain walls and skylights.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703093)</p>
